# ============================================================
#  .gitignore  —  data_structure (C / MinGW + VS Code)
#  说明：只忽略「生成物」和「本机配置」，源码和题目数据都要提交。
# ============================================================

# ---------- 编译产物（gcc / MinGW / MSVC） ----------
*.exe
*.out
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.exp
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.idb
*.gch
*.pch
*.d
*.su
*.map
*.stackdump
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov

# 崩溃转储
*.dmp
core.*

# ---------- 构建输出目录 ----------
build/
out/
bin/
obj/
Debug/
Release/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt

# ---------- 编辑器 / IDE 本机配置 ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej

# ---------- 日志与临时文件 ----------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# ---------- 操作系统杂项 ----------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
